  "description": "Catherine Elemore transmigrated into the body of a villainess in the novel *Star of the Revolution*—putting her directly on the purge list of her absolute favorite character, Ethias.\n\nSuddenly, a mysterious system forces a mission on her: secretly sponsor Ethias and help him succeed in his revolution without ever getting caught, or face instant death!\n\nTo survive, Catherine acts like a rich, arrogant villainess in front of Ethias while secretly funneling money and resources to aid his cause behind his back. She plans to slip away to a neighboring kingdom once the revolution succeeds... until Ethias corners her with a cold gaze and says: \"Now that you've sponsored me, you have to take responsibility—by staying by my side for the rest of your life.\"\n\n[Original Novel](https://page.kakao.com/content/66769216)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69773496), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%95%85%EB%85%80%EA%B0%80-%ED%9B%84%EC%9B%90%EC%9D%84-%EB%93%A4%ED%82%B4/4925)",
